        <mxCell id="we8_Jbl5YYKyv2Kxifmp-68" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Dragonlance Telemetry Project&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;--animation-duration: 660ms;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--animation-duration: 660ms;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;5-node HITL telemetry network across multiple devices and architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Bridges between RTOS and POSIX environments, streaming and routing packets from source to specific destinations (telemetry display or user interface)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Renders flight link diagnostics (based on packet transfers) on a React (or Blazor) UI equipped with controls to dynamically reconfigure the ARQ mode for the flight link&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
